                  %a{:href => "D'Auria-Fre+formulation+of+supergravity#CastellaniDAuriaFre"} CDF91, §III.8.2-4
                  is really just to motivate the form of the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bianchi+identities"} Bianchi identities
