          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#Duff99
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Duff"}> Mike Duff
              , chapter 1 of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+World+in+Eleven+Dimensions"}> The World in Eleven Dimensions
                  \: Supergravity, Supermembranes and M-theory
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.crcpress.com/The-World-in-Eleven-Dimensions-Supergravity-supermembranes-and-M-theory/Duff/9780750306720"} ISBN:9780750306720
          %h3#general General
          %p
            That there is a maximal dimension
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi d
                  %mo =
                  %mn 11
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d = 11
            in which supergravity may exist was found in
          %ul
            %li#Nahm78
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Werner+Nahm"}> Werner Nahm
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supersymmetries+and+their+Representations"} Supersymmetries and their Representations
              %strong 135
              (1978) 149 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/record/120988/"}> spire
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://cds.cern.ch/record/132743/files/197709213.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The theory was then actually constructed (as a
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lagrangian+field+theory"} Lagrangian field theory
          %ul
            %li#CremmerJuliaScherk78
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eug%C3%A8ne+Cremmer"}> Eugène Cremmer
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernard+Julia"} Bernard Julia
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jo%C3%ABl+Scherk"} Joël Scherk
              = succeed "," do
                %em Supergravity in theory in 11 dimensions
              %strong 76
              (1978) 409 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(78)90894-8"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(78)90894-8
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The claim of the derivation of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi D
                  %mo =
                  %mn 11
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} D=11
            supergravity in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergeometry"} supergeometry
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+torsion+constraint"} torsion constraint
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bianchi+identities"} Bianchi identities
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+spacetime"} super spacetime
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supermanifolds"} supermanifolds
            (“
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/superspace"}> superspace
            ”) is due to
          %ul
            %li#CremmerFerrara80
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eug%C3%A8ne+Cremmer"}> Eugène Cremmer
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Ferrara"} Sergio Ferrara
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Formulation of Eleven-Dimensional Supergravity in Superspace
                %strong 91
                (1980) 61 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(80)90662-0"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(80)90662-0
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#BrinkHowe80
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lars+Brink"}> Lars Brink
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Howe"} Paul Howe
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Eleven-Dimensional Supergravity on the Mass-Shell in Superspace
                %strong 91
                (1980) 384 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(80)91002-3"}> doi:10.1016/0370-2693(80)91002-3
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and in the mild variation (using a manifestly
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality-symmetric+C-field"} duality-symmetric
            super-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+C-field"} C-field
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flux+density"} flux density
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "#CastellaniDAuriaFré91"} Castellani, D’Auria &amp; Fré 1991, §III.8.5
          %p A proof of this claim is laid out in
          %ul
            %li#GiotopoulosSatiSchreiber24
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grigorios+Giotopoulos"}> Grigorios Giotopoulos
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Flux+Quantization+on+11d+Superspace"} Flux Quantization on 11d Superspace
              %strong 2024
              82 (2024) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.16456"}> arXiv:2403.16456
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP07(2024)082"} doi:10.1007/JHEP07(2024)082
          %p
            using further lemmas and then heavy computer algebra checks (
            %a{:href => "/schreiber/show/Flux+Quantization+on+11d+Superspace#AncillaryFiles"}> here
            ).
          %p
            With focus on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kaluza-Klein+compactification"} Kaluza-Klein compactification
            to 4d
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} anti de Sitter spacetime
          %ul
            %li#DuffNilssonPope86
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Duff"}> Michael Duff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bengt+Nilsson"} Bengt Nilsson
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Pope"} Christopher Pope
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Kaluza-Klein supergravity
                %strong 130
                1–2 (1986) 1-142 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/record/229417"}> spire:229417
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-1573(86)90163-8"} doi:10.1016/0370-1573(86)90163-8
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Duff"}> Michael Duff
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bengt+Nilsson"} Bengt Nilsson
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Pope"} Christopher Pope
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Kaluza-Klein Supergravity 2025
                %em Half a Century of Supergravity
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.07710"}> arXiv:2502.07710
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The history as of the 1990s, with an eye towards the development to
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
          %ul
            %li#Duff99
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mike+Duff"}> Mike Duff
              , chapter I of:
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/The+World+in+Eleven+Dimensions"}> The World in Eleven Dimensions
                  \: Supergravity, Supermembranes and M-theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.crcpress.com/The-World-in-Eleven-Dimensions-Supergravity-supermembranes-and-M-theory/Duff/9780750306720"} publisher
          %p
            The description of 11d supergravity in terms of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fr%C3%A9-Regge+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fré-Regge formulation of supergravity
            originates in
          %ul
            %li{:id => "DAuriaFré82"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"}> Riccardo D'Auria
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GeometricSupergravity.pdf", :title => "Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup"} Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup
              %strong 201
              (1982) 101-140 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(82)90376-5"}> doi:10.1016/0550-3213(82)90376-5
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GeometricSupergravityErrata.pdf", :title => "errata"} errata
          %p of which a textbook account is in
          %ul
            %li{:id => "CastellaniDAuriaFré91"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/0224"} doi:10.1142/0224
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://epdf.pub/supergravity-and-superstrings-a-geometric-perspective-vol-2-supergravity.html"} epdf
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/CastellaniDAuriaFre-ChIII8.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p reviewed again in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"}> Pietro Fré
              , §6.4 in:
              = succeed "," do
