              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9711055"} arXiv:hep-th/9711055
          %p
            and around (4.2) of
            %a{:href => "#Tsimpis04"} Tsimpis 04
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fre+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fré formulation
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/first-order+formulation+of+gravity"} first-order formulation
